OL,3,GNEWSA'Why I spend my free time keeping
OL,4,Aducks safe'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman is using her spare time to
OL,7,Fpatrol a river after a number of ducks
OL,8,Fwere found injured and dead.
OL,10,FDorchester Duck Patrol group formed in
OL,11,Fthe spring after a number of attacks on
OL,12,Fthe wildlife that live on the River
OL,13,FFrome.
OL,15,FIn the past six months, five attacks
OL,16,Fhave been reported to Dorset Police.
OL,18,FGillian May the patrol group founder
OL,19,Fsaid: "I felt like I really had to do
OL,20,Fsomething to try and protect them,
OL,21,Fprotect our innocent wildlife from
OL,22,Fthese mindless vandals."
